<title>USA: Sabre poised to vault at NYSE market debut.</title>
<headline>Sabre poised to vault at NYSE market debut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Sabre Group Holdings Inc were indicated at $30 to $32 each ahead of their IPO market debut, according to the New York Stock Exchange on Friday.</p>
<p>Based in Fort Worth, Texas, the AMR Corp unit provides computer travel reservations and information. It offered 20.2 million shares, which priced at $27 each.</p>
